[
  {
    "id": 0,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "はぁ、ふぅ。マナの濃度が高いと、\nやっぱキツいなぁ……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Phew... The high mana concentration really takes it out of you..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アイラ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Isla"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 1,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "はぁ、はぁ……踏んだり蹴ったりだ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "*panting* Just our luck..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ルトガー",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Rutger"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 2,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "でも、ルトガーの最初の一撃で助かったね。\nあれ、よく反応したよね！？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "But that first strike of yours really saved us! How'd you react so fast?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アイラ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Isla"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 3,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "まぁな……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "That's just how I am."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ルトガー",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Rutger"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 4,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "それより、早くこの領域から出るぞ。\n長居してたら、命がいくつあっても足りねぇ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "We need to get out of this area. Stay here too long and nine lives wouldn't be enough."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ルトガー",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Rutger"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 5,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "特に何も見当たらなそうだしな",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Doesn't look like there's anything worth finding anyway."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ルトガー",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Rutger"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 6,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "でもさ、みんなを探さないと",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "But we have to look for the others!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アイラ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Isla"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 7,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "歩いてりゃ、そのうち出会うだろ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "We'll run into them eventually if we keep moving."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ルトガー",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Rutger"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 8,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ちょ、ちょっと待ってよ！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "H-hold on a second!"
        }
